{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532140/", "pk": 532140, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/", "pk": 110654, "shortname": "sixfinscharter", "name": "Six Fins Boat Charter - Perry Marina", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Custom Activities Combo Charter", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Private Custom Activities Combo Charter", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 750, "description": "#Create your dream adventure with our Custom Charter in Key West. \n\n#Start times are flexible upon request. \n\n##Duration\nMondays through Sundays—Plan your itinerary. Six, eight, and ten-hour excursions are available. \n\n##About\nOPEN ITINERARY & CUSTOMIZABLE— Create your dream adventure with our Local Charter Captains in Key West. Whether celebrating a special occasion or simply seeking a personalized experience tailored to your interests, combine our fixed itinerary experiences. The possibilities are endless, from romantic sunsets, harbor trips, snorkeling, sandbar and dolphin cruises, reef fishing, and thrilling backwater eco excursions.\n\n##Extra\nAll charter passengers may use The Perry Hotel and Marina Pools as my guests before and after the charter. David, Owner", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, Fl.", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT ACTION REQUIRED\nSix Fins Charter – Booking Confirmation\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe're excited to welcome you aboard your private Six Fins Charter experience! Please review the important details below to ensure a smooth and memorable day on the water.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n✅ Before Your Trip\n\nFor trips up to six passengers:\n\n👉 Each passenger must complete the insurance waiver (including adults on behalf of minors): [here] (https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/rd9k5tiavpwper7h2rhaqh/web/)\n\nAND for trips with 7th and 8th passengers:\n\n👉 The primary renter (21+ years old) and captain must complete the Bareboat Agreement together at the dock before departure, but prior to arrival, you may begin: [here](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/ez5636zbxexwrng7dtz6mq/web/)\n\nI acknowledge that for groups of 7–8 passengers, the following fee is not included in my booking and is paid directly to the captain at the dock before departure: a captain fee of $65/hr. and a fuel charge of $35/hr. will be charged to my credit card. A suggested 20% tip is not included.\n\nThe boat must have a captain. Please choose one of the three captains listed on the bareboat waiver, or contact Six Fins Charter at (305) 906-2880 for assistance.\n\nPlease complete all required forms in advance so we can depart on time.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n⚓ Your Experience – Open Itinerary & Fully Customizable\n\nThis private charter is designed entirely around you.\n\nPopular experiences include:\n• Dolphin watching\n• Snorkeling vibrant reefs\n• Sandbar relaxation stops\n• Scenic harbor cruising\n• Casual, family-friendly fishing (when arranged in advance and conditions permit)\n• Backcountry eco exploration\n• Romantic sunset cruising\n\n🎣 Important Information About Combo Fishing\n\nIf fishing is included in your Custom Activities Combo, it is limited to 45 minutes and offered as a casual recreational activity within a multi-experience charter in the Gulf and backcountry. It is ideal for children, beginners, and families who would like to spend part of the day fishing while also enjoying activities such as sandbars, snorkeling, sightseeing, or dolphin watching. \n\nAvailable fishing time depends on your selected itinerary, travel time, weather, sea conditions, and how much of the charter you choose to devote to other activities. Combo fishing is not the same experience as a dedicated fishing charter and does not provide the same preparation, fishing time, effort, or fishing focus. Anyone 16 or older must purchase a 3-day non-resident license, which costs $17.00 online through [Go Outdoors Florida](https://license.gooutdoorsflorida.com/Licensing/CustomerLookup.aspx)\n\nIf you want a true Key West fishing experience, reserve our Private Patch Reef Fishing charter.\n\nWe select routes between Atlantic and Gulf waters based on weather and sea conditions to ensure comfort and safety.\n\nStart times are flexible. The day is yours.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🛥 About the Boat\n\n• 30' Jeanneau NC 895 Weekender cabin cruiser\n• Private enclosed head (toilet)\n• USCG-certified safety equipment\n• Licensed USCG captains\n• 5-star-reviewed experience\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n📍 Check-In Details\n\nLocation: Dock A, Slip #32\n7001 Shrimp Rd, Stock Island, FL 33040\n\nFree parking is available adjacent to The Perry Hotel & Marina.\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes prior to departure.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🧳 What's Included\n\n• Cooler with ice\n• Bottled water & light snacks\n• Adult noodles\n• Snorkeling gear\n• Basic fishing gear for casual Combo fishing (when arranged in advance and conditions permit). Limited to 45-minutes\n• Lily pad (upon request)\n• Stand-up paddleboard (upon request)\n• Two bean bag chairs (upon request)\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🚫 Not Included\n\n• Meals & beverages\n• Towels\n• Infant/toddler USCG-approved life jackets (must be provided by guest)\n• Captain & crew gratuity (customary 20% minimum if satisfied)\n\nCasual Combo fishing uses frozen bait only—no chum or live bait. Frozen bait is available at the customer’s expense.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🩺 Health & Safety\n\nYour safety is our top priority.\n\n• All charters follow USCG regulations\n• Safety briefing provided before departure\n• Life jackets available for all guests\n• Activities are weather- and sea-condition dependent\n• Food allergies or dietary restrictions: reply to this email and let us know in advance so we can prepare.\n• Prone to seasickness: tell us ahead of time, and we'll suggest what to take before boarding.\n\nGuests should be in good physical health and comfortable around water. Please notify us in advance if anyone has heart conditions, back or neck issues, recent surgeries, is pregnant, or has mobility limitations.\n\nChildren must be supervised at all times.\n\nExcessive intoxication or unsafe behavior may result in early termination of the charter without refund.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n⚠ Disclaimers\n\n• Itineraries are subject to weather, tides, and captain's discretion\n• Wildlife sightings cannot be guaranteed\n• Snorkeling and sandbar access depend on conditions\n• Late arrivals may reduce charter time\n• Six Fins is not responsible for lost or damaged personal items\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n🎁 Complimentary Exclusive Access\n\nAs my charter guests, you may enjoy access to The Perry Hotel & Marina pools and fitness center before and after your trip.\n\nMake a full day of it.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\n⭐ Reviews\n\nWe would truly appreciate a review after your experience. Your feedback helps us continue delivering five-star private charters in Key West.\n\n――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――――\n\nBest regards,\n\nDavid McFadden\nOwner, Six Fins Charter", "cancellation_notes": "Enjoy peace of mind with our cancellation policy:\n\nAll reservations made within 7 calendar days of departure are non-refundable. Customer cancellations made prior to 7 calendar days before departure will receive a full refund. If Six Fins Charter cancels due to unsafe weather conditions or other circumstances initiated by the owner/operator, the customer will receive a full refund.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Pick your day — sandbars, snorkeling, sunset, all of it", "short_description": "Private, fully customizable Key West boat charter for sandbars, snorkeling, dolphins, sunset, casual family fishing, and special occasions.", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532140/images/1184251/", "pk": 1184251, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dVPju7rSo279Z1WyNqlC", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dVPju7rSo279Z1WyNqlC", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532140/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dVPju7rSo279Z1WyNqlC", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/dVPju7rSo279Z1WyNqlC", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532140/images/1228638/", "pk": 1228638, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OfeqdTQAShyXRHgu1eXI", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OfeqdTQAShyXRHgu1eXI", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "